{title: Srivalli (Telugu)}
{artist: Sid Sriram Telugu}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Ninu Chusthu Unte,        Kannulu Rendu [A]Thippesthaa [E]ve
[E]Nee Choopulapaine,        Reppalu Vesi [A]Kappesthaa [E]ve
[A]Kanipinchani Devunne,        [E]Kannaarpaka Choosthaave
[A]Kannula Edhute Nenunte,        [B]Kaadantunnaa [E]ve
[E]Choope Bangaramaayane, Srivalli,        [D]Maate Maanikyamaaye [E]ne
[E]Choope Bangaramaayane, Srivalli,        [Bm]Navve Navarathnamaaye [E]ne
[E]Annitiki Epudu [B]Mundunde Nenu,        [E]Mee Enake Ipudu [A]Paduthunnaanu
[E]Evvariki Epudu [B]Thalavanchani Nenu,        [E]Nee Patee Choosetandhuku
[A]Thalane Vanchaanu,        [G]Intha Bathuku Bathiki
Nee [A]Inti Chuttu Thirigaane,        [G]Isumantha Nannu Choosthe Chaalu
[A]Chaalanukunnaane,        [E]Choope Bangaramaayane, Srivalli
[D]Maate Maanikyamaaye [E]ne,        [E]Choope Bangaramaayane, Srivalli
[Bm]Navve Navarathnamaaye [E]ne,        [E]Nee Snehithurallu [B]O Mostharuguntaru
[E]Andukane Emo [A]Nuvvandanguntaavu,        [E]Paddhenimidhi Ellu [B]Vachhaaya Chaalu
[E]Nuvvekaadevvarainaa [A]Mudduga Untaaru,        [G]Erra Chandanam Cheera Kadithe
[A]Raayi Kooda Raakumaare,        [G]Edu Raalla Dhuddhulu Pedithe
[A]Evathainaa Andagatthe, Ayinaa,        [E]Choope Bangaramaayane, Srivalli
[D]Maate Maanikyamaaye [E]ne,        [E]Choope Bangaramaayane, Srivalli
[Bm]Navve Navarathnamaaye [E]ne
